# Self-ignoring build cache. Keep this file, ignore everything beside it.
#
# These are pristine pre-lockup video masters, about 11 MB. They exist so
# add_lockup.py can be non-destructive and therefore idempotent by
# construction rather than by a guard: every run rebuilds from here, so a
# second run is byte-identical to the first.
#
# They are duplicates of masters that already live in
# docs/growth/reel-campaign-ab/, so committing them stores the same video
# twice. The repo root .gitignore has no rule that would catch them, and
# another session commits to this repo concurrently, so without this file one
# `git add -A` puts 11 MB of duplicated video into a PUBLIC repo.
#
# If this folder is ever lost, rebuild it by copying the pre-lockup cuts from
# docs/growth/reel-campaign-ab/. Do NOT copy the bilingual ones from there
# into the campaign package itself: those carry the RETIRED logo burned into
# their pixels. See RETIRED-LOGO-WARNING.md in that folder.
*
!.gitignore
